{"ref":"character:para-kooleo","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Para Kooleo is a playable character from the base game version of Vampire Survivors that was introduced in Patch 1.15. Their starting weapon is ",{"i":"Sprite-Penshin_Fatcha.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:penshin-fatcha"}," ",{"t":"Penshin Fatcha","r":"weapon:penshin-fatcha"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["6 June 2026 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Kooleo"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["EX_PARACOOLIO"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["CharacterController_EX_ParaCoolio"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Penshin_Fatcha.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:penshin-fatcha"}," ",{"t":"Penshin Fatcha","r":"weapon:penshin-fatcha"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Survive 20 min in The Lycaeum."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 153"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[["No"]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+30%"]]},{"label":"Duration","cells":[["+30%"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Para Kooleo can be unlocked by surviving 20 minutes in ",{"t":"The Lycaeum","r":"stage:the-lycaeum"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Para Kooleo can be unlocked in ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"fastisfortuna\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Para Kooleo and all of his ",{"t":"skins","r":"relic:mindbender"}," start with +30% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"}," and +30% ",{"i":"Sprite-Duration.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:duration"}," ",{"t":"Duration","r":"powerup:duration"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Para Kooleo has an \"HP-Critical\" skill that activates as soon as his HP drops below 20% of his ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},", which triggers a ",{"i":"Sprite-Vacuum.png","w":24,"h":24}," Vacuum. The skill may only be activated again after recovering all HP. Receiving fatal damage resulting in a game-over will not trigger the skill."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["If the player has evolved Penshin Fatcha at least once, this Vacuum will be replaced with a Lavatrix Machina."]}]},{"k":"p","c":["Whenever Para Kooleo evolves a weapon, his hidden ",{"i":"Sprite-Acquazzone.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:acquazzone"}," ",{"t":"Acquazzone","r":"weapon:acquazzone"}," will trigger for 7 seconds. This Acquazzone has a base damage of 60 and a base ",{"i":"Sprite-Amount.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:amount"}," ",{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"}," of 12. Whenever it is triggered, this Acquazzone gains 6 base damage."]},{"k":"p","c":["When playing as one of Para Kooleo's alternate skins, his starting weapon loses the ability to evolve at the exchange of Limit Break being far more effective. Each level of Limit Break will be five times as effective and every weapon can also receive +2 ",{"i":"Sprite-Amount.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:amount"}," ",{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"}," (Max 20) as a potential bonus."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"darkana","title":"Darkana","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["After obtaining the ",{"i":"Sprite-Darkasso.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:darkasso"}," ",{"t":"Darkasso","r":"relic:darkasso"},", an initially hidden achievement is revealed to the player."]},{"k":"quote","c":["VIII - Edge of the Earth: Trigger a Lavatrix Machina with Para Kooleo."]},{"k":"p","c":["Completing this achievement will unlock the Darkana: ",{"i":"Sprite-Edge_of_the_Earth_(VIII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:edge-of-the-earth-viii"}," ",{"t":"Edge of the Earth (VIII)","r":"arcana:edge-of-the-earth-viii"},"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Para Kooleo works best with a limited number of weapons and ",{"i":"Sprite-Silent_Old_Sanctuary_(XX).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:silent-old-sanctuary-xx"}," ",{"t":"Silent Old Sanctuary (XX)","r":"arcana:silent-old-sanctuary-xx"},". This allows him to dedicate all chests obtained during a run into evolving ",{"i":"Sprite-Penshin_Fatcha.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:penshin-fatcha"}," ",{"t":"Penshin Fatcha","r":"weapon:penshin-fatcha"},", getting it to absurd power levels further boosted by Silent Old Sanctuary. This also applies to his alternate forms thanks to their enhanced limit breaks. Aside from that, however, the base form's optimal playstyle differs greatly from that of the alternate forms:"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["To maximize the base form's power, it is recommended to play on a stage like ",{"t":"Ode to Castlevania","r":"stage:ode-to-castlevania-stage"},", where the plentiful evolution chests available from a massive number of bosses can turn Penshin Fatcha into a juggernaut of a weapon. For even more chests, it is recommended to get ",{"i":"Sprite-Moonlight_Bolero_(VI).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:moonlight-bolero-vi"}," ",{"t":"Moonlight Bolero (VI)","r":"arcana:moonlight-bolero-vi"}," relatively early."]},{"c":["On the other hand, chests are mostly wasted on the alternate forms, since they don't evolve; instead, the priority should be maximizing experience gain with ",{"i":"Sprite-Crown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:crown"}," ",{"t":"Crown","r":"passive:crown"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Wicked_Season_(XIII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:wicked-season-xiii"}," ",{"t":"Wicked Season (XIII)","r":"arcana:wicked-season-xiii"},", etc."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"gallery-sprite","title":"Sprite","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Para_Kooleo.png","w":102,"h":120,"c":["Para Kooleo's sprite"]},{"i":"Sprite-Para_Kooleo_(Tonno_Subito).png","w":114,"h":120,"c":["Para Kooleo's Tonn Subito sprite"]},{"i":"Sprite-Para_Kooleo_(Tonnado).png","w":117,"h":120,"c":["Para Kooleo's Tonnado sprite"]},{"i":"Sprite-Para_Kooleo_(Tonn'omoto).png","w":114,"h":120,"c":["Para Kooleo's Tonn'omoto sprite"]},{"i":"Sprite-Para_Kooleo_(Tonn'oddeeo).png","w":108,"h":120,"c":["Para Kooleo's Tonn'oddeeo sprite"]},{"i":"Sprite-Para_Kooleo_(Tonne).png","w":111,"h":120,"c":["Para Kooleo's Tonne sprite"]},{"i":"Sprite-Para_Kooleo_(Unsurpassed).png","w":102,"h":120,"c":["Para Kooleo's Unsurpassed sprite"]},{"i":"Unlock-Para_Kooleo.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Unlocks menu icon"]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-animated","title":"Animated","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Animated-Para_Kooleo.gif","w":102,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]},{"i":"Animated-Para_Kooleo_(Tonno_Subito).gif","w":114,"h":120,"c":["Tonn Subito movement animation"]},{"i":"Animated-Para_Kooleo_(Tonnado).gif","w":117,"h":120,"c":["Tonnado movement animation"]},{"i":"Animated-Para_Kooleo_(Tonn'omoto).gif","w":114,"h":120,"c":["Tonn'omoto movement animation"]},{"i":"Animated-Para_Kooleo_(Tonn'oddeeo).gif","w":108,"h":120,"c":["Tonn'oddeeo movement animation"]},{"i":"Animated-Para_Kooleo_(Tonne).gif","w":111,"h":120,"c":["Tonne movement animation"]},{"i":"Animated-Para_Kooleo_(Unsurpassed).gif","w":102,"h":120,"c":["Unsurpassed movement animation"]}]}]}]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update ",{"i":"Steam_logo.svg","w":16,"h":16,"a":"Steam"}," 6 June 2026 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["beta ",{"i":"Steam_logo.svg","w":16,"h":16,"a":"Steam"}," 16 April 2026 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fix Para Kooleo being unplayable online"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["beta ",{"i":"Steam_logo.svg","w":16,"h":16,"a":"Steam"}," 1 April 2026 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Released in beta version."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Para Kooleo is based off of the ",{"t":"kelpie","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kelpie"},", a mythical shape-shifting aquatic spirit of Scottish folklore.[1][2]"]},{"c":["Para Kooleo's Tonn'oddeeo sprite has a spiked shell that makes it resemble ",{"t":"Slowbro","x":"https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Slowbro_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"}," from the ",{"t":"Pokémon","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pok%C3%A9mon"}," franchise."]},{"c":["The name Para Kooleo's is a pun on the Italian term \"paraculo\", an informal way of describing someone who always looks out for their own interests (para = protect, culo = buttocks)."]},{"c":["Para Kooleo's unlock spell \"fastisfortuna\" seems to be a pun on the Latin phrase \"Fortis fortuna adiuvat\", meaning \"fortune favors the bold\". The modified phrase here can instead be read as \"fast is for tuna\", alluding to the character's tuna-based weapon and to this fish's notorious breakneck speed."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"references","title":"References","blocks":[{"k":"ol","items":[{"c":[{"t":"https://folklorescotland.com/kelpies/","x":"https://folklorescotland.com/kelpies/"}]},{"c":[{"t":"https://scotlands-stories.com/scottish-kelpie-legends/","x":"https://scotlands-stories.com/scottish-kelpie-legends/"}]}]}],"subs":[]}]}